### ==============================================================================
### MEMBER DIRECTORY, VERIFICATION, & COORDINATOR STATS APIS
### ==============================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api
@adminToken = REPLACE_WITH_ADMIN_BEARER_TOKEN
@adminSecretKey = BYK_SUPER_ADMIN_ALIGARH_SECRET_2026

### 1. List All Members (Supports role, status, and search filters)
GET {{baseUrl}}/members?role=Member&status=active&search=Ravi
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
x-admin-secret-key: {{adminSecretKey}}

### 2. Update Member Status (Active / Suspended / Rejected)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/members/MEMBER_USER_ID_HERE/status
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
x-admin-secret-key: {{adminSecretKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "active"
}

### 3. Verify Member Directly (Set Designation & Fee Paid)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/members/MEMBER_USER_ID_HERE/verify
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
x-admin-secret-key: {{adminSecretKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "feePaid": true,
  "feeAmount": 500,
  "designation": "Executive Coordinator (Aligarh District)"
}

### 4. Export Members Directory to Excel (.xlsx)
GET {{baseUrl}}/members/export/excel
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
x-admin-secret-key: {{adminSecretKey}}

### 5. Get Today's Birthday Members & Poster Candidates
GET {{baseUrl}}/stats/birthday-members

### 6. Get Coordinator Personal Report & Referral Stats
GET {{baseUrl}}/stats/coordinator-report
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 7. Get All Coordinators Leaderboard & Recruitment Analytics
GET {{baseUrl}}/stats/coordinator-leaderboard
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
x-admin-secret-key: {{adminSecretKey}}
